# Issue API Endpoints

## Endpoints Covered
- `GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/issues` — List repo issues
- `GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/issues/{number}` — Get single issue
- `GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/issues/{number}/comments` — List comments
- `GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/labels` — List labels

